 "brief": "MK-028 Base tower and antenna. Matched to the Midjourney pick: a two-storey framed tower block (a wide lower storey with a tall warm window and green/amber status lamps, a dark slab band with hazard trim, a narrower upper storey with a porthole), a framed porch with a glowing door, a dish on the roof, and a lattice mast with a work platform, whip antennas and a red beacon on top. The beacon is the base's landmark: you can see it from anywhere on the Moon tile, and it blinks faster when someone is calling home.",
